{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>巴巴多斯天后Rihanna出名是各大品牌的搶手貨，她經常為品牌拍攝廣告。最近Rihanna就與1歲女兒Rocki Irish一同為一法國時尚服飾品牌拍攝新一輯廣告。</p><p>Rihanna與女兒同穿上黑色皮褸「母女裝」拍攝廣告，其中一張是Rihanna親吻女兒額角。此外，品牌亦公布廣告拍攝花絮片，其中見到全裸的Rihanna手抱赤裸上身啜全手指的女兒緊貼其胸部，場面溫馨！</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T07:43:49.746248+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T07:01:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T07:37:13.962865+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T07:37:13.962865+00:00","content_hash":"5c328c0fa1ea6a728515d9daa2d40559031f01ba2850d0074a31d780eae1e92b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}